flowchart LR
  Source["Standard, framework, law, contract or regulator source"]
  Applicability["Signed applicability and interpretation decision"]
  Control["Stable VAT-MSA control objective and owner"]
  Architecture["Trust boundary, component and enforcement design"]
  Delivery["Code, infrastructure, configuration, policy and process"]
  Telemetry["Runtime telemetry and audit event"]
  Test["Automated, manual and independent verification"]
  Evidence["Hashed evidence object with scope, freshness and retention"]
  Assurance["Independent assessment and finding"]
  Improve["Risk treatment and continual improvement"]

  Source --> Applicability
  Applicability --> Control
  Control --> Architecture
  Architecture --> Delivery
  Delivery --> Telemetry
  Delivery --> Test
  Telemetry --> Evidence
  Test --> Evidence
  Evidence --> Assurance
  Assurance --> Improve
  Improve --> Applicability
